    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="356.56" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">
        <Raw><![CDATA[写 &lt; 就原样印出这 4 个字符，要显示尖括号请改用 CDATA]]></Raw>
      </Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="510" top="439.04">
