    <Positioned left="65" top="1269.8" width="1087">
      <Text fontSize="28" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">三、常见误解与动手核对</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="1307.8" width="532">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#7A4FD3" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">容易踩的坑</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="620" top="1307.8" width="532">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#1F8A5F" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">动手核对</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="50" top="1350.8">
      <Container width="10" height="10" color="#7A4FD3" borderRadius="5"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="72" top="1341.8" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">把 #33FFFFFF 当成 20% 白：末尾 FF 表示完全不透明，前缀反而不合法。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="50" top="1423.28">
      <Container width="10" height="10" color="#7A4FD3" borderRadius="5"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="72" top="1414.28" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">
        <Raw><![CDATA[用 &amp; 转义 &：解析器不解码，屏幕上看到的就是实体名本身。]]></Raw>
      </Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1350.8">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1341.8" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">把 alpha 从开头移到末尾再渲染，比较透明度</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1388.24">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1379.24" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">
        <Raw><![CDATA[用 CDATA 印一行含 < > & 的文字，确认没有实体残留]]></Raw>
      </Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1460.72">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1451.72" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">行内混排两种颜色的 Text，检查基线是否齐平</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="1511.5">
      <Container width="1104" height="1" color="#DCE2EC"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="1522" width="760">
